DeckDescription = "The bowl. The pipe climbs round the outside and pours in at the rim; swirl the eighty-metre funnel as fast or as slow as your nerve allows, then fall through the hole into the sunken tunnel out. The wall is the racing line; the saucer is the slow way down."
